{"ts": 1791256251.5884109, "type": "step", "step": 28, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Evaluating agents"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 16, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.3691804618986463}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7216425168345921, "motivation": 0.8089364796632394, "reliance": 0.45602770298460465, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 1.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": ["p6"]}}
{"ts": 1791256252.719477, "type": "step", "step": 29, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the exact eval wording from the reading, in plain English:\n\n- pass@k means the agent succeeds on at least one of k runs.\n- pass^k means the agent succeeds on all k runs.\n- Use pass^k when you care about reliability, because deployment needs the system to work consistently, not just occasionally.\n\nIf you want, I can help you turn that into a polished paragraph for your writeup.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=16 feed 1m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 16, "app": "feed", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.3691804618986463}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7256425168345921, "motivation": 0.8089364796632394, "reliance": 0.45602770298460465, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 2, "feed_minutes": 2.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": ["p6", "p2"]}}
