{"ts": 1791256262.952126, "type": "step", "step": 38, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let's keep moving. Since you\u2019ve got the core definitions now, I want you to do one quick check for me: type your environment sentence exactly as you\u2019d put it in the writeup. I\u2019ll tell you if it\u2019s good or if it needs a tiny fix. If you want to skip drafting, you can use this version:\n\n\u201cAn environment is defined by the state, observations, actions, and dynamics; reward is separate and describes what matters for the task.\u201d", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\nStudent: what does pomdp actually mean?\n[activity] t=38 messages 1m", "t": 39, "activity": [{"t": 38, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20270325316450874, "pomdp": 0.21955011905806734, "pass_k": 0.47738524472827043}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7986425168345921, "motivation": 0.5580428316969153, "reliance": 0.6160277029846046, "persistence": 0.3148076887655993, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 5.0, "nag": 2.4695874584999995, "seen_posts": ["p6", "p2", "p5", "p4"]}}
{"ts": 1791256264.68352, "type": "step", "step": 39, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "POMDP stands for Partially Observable Markov Decision Process.\n\nIn plain English: it means the agent does not get to see the full true state of the world. Instead, it sees observations that are incomplete or noisy, so it has to keep some internal belief about what\u2019s really going on and act under uncertainty.\n\nA simple way to remember it:\n- MDP = fully observable decision process\n- POMDP = partially observable decision process\n\nFor your writeup, you only need a short mention: if the agent can\u2019t see the whole state, it must maintain a belief and may need to gather information by acting.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "environments"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=39 messages 4m", "t": 43, "activity": [{"t": 39, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20270325316450874, "pomdp": 0.32743118255332326, "pass_k": 0.47738524472827043}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7986425168345921, "motivation": 0.5580428316969153, "reliance": 0.6160277029846046, "persistence": 0.3148076887655993, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 5.0, "nag": 2.7287112209499993, "seen_posts": ["p6", "p2", "p5", "p4"]}}
